WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:58:54.030 --> 00:58:54.830
-Karl?
-KARL: Yeah?

00:58:54.863 --> 00:58:56.732
Do you like the, uh,
the Pierce deal?

00:58:56.765 --> 00:59:00.069
I do. I do, yes.
Yeah. Oh, yeah.

00:59:00.336 --> 00:59:01.804
(LOGAN ROY CHUCKLES) Bullshit.

00:59:02.171 --> 00:59:03.439
Boar on the floor.

00:59:03.606 --> 00:59:04.807
(KARL SCOFFS)

00:59:05.141 --> 00:59:06.142
LOGAN: Hey!

00:59:07.644 --> 00:59:10.479
-(CHUCKLES) Okay.
-It's a game.

00:59:10.646 --> 00:59:12.848
In the corner, over there.
Stand there.

00:59:12.881 --> 00:59:15.318
-Go, go, go, go, go.
-(KARL LAUGHS)

00:59:19.021 --> 00:59:20.790
All right. (SIGHS)

00:59:23.526 --> 00:59:24.727
Tom?

00:59:25.328 --> 00:59:26.429
-Me?
-Yeah.

00:59:26.495 --> 00:59:27.764
-Uh, Pierce?
-Yeah.

00:59:28.030 --> 00:59:29.032
Um...

00:59:29.965 --> 00:59:32.368
Well, there's a lot of...
(CLEARS THROAT)

00:59:32.401 --> 00:59:33.636
factors, and...

00:59:34.203 --> 00:59:38.107
but yes. I personally--
I like it. I like it.

00:59:38.341 --> 00:59:39.842
Boar on the floor over there.

00:59:43.313 --> 00:59:44.581
Gerri, stand up.

00:59:45.181 --> 00:59:46.149
Stand up!

00:59:49.084 --> 00:59:49.918
Pierce?

00:59:50.152 --> 00:59:51.654
Couldn't tell you.
Couldn't tell you. Don't know.

00:59:51.687 --> 00:59:53.122
-Have you played it before?
-No!

00:59:53.456 --> 00:59:55.458
Well, actually, I...

00:59:56.159 --> 00:59:58.595
To be perfectly honest,
I've-- I've had a few doubts.

00:59:59.462 --> 01:00:00.462
LOGAN: Honesty.

01:00:00.963 --> 01:00:03.333
You see, everybody?
Do you see?

01:00:03.966 --> 01:00:04.968
Honesty.

01:00:06.035 --> 01:00:07.170
Greg, stand up.

01:00:09.972 --> 01:00:11.807
Did you get any orders
from my brother,

01:00:11.841 --> 01:00:13.710
the fuckin' Conscience
of the Prairies?

01:00:14.543 --> 01:00:15.678
-Me?
-LOGAN: Yeah.

01:00:15.711 --> 01:00:19.048
I... don't... Uh...

01:00:20.949 --> 01:00:22.652
Yeah. I-- 'Cause I--
(STAMMERS)

01:00:22.685 --> 01:00:24.453
I've had some doubts too.

01:00:24.520 --> 01:00:26.955
Oh? Fucking doubter.
Over there.

01:00:27.389 --> 01:00:30.827
But the rules are that you're
spared if you tell the truth,

01:00:30.893 --> 01:00:33.729
-and I just told you the truth!
-Oh, oh! There are rules?

01:00:33.962 --> 01:00:35.831
-GREG HIRSCH: Right?
-Do you know something, Greg?

01:00:35.864 --> 01:00:40.770
There are no fucking rules.
(WHISPERS) Over there.

01:00:41.970 --> 01:00:44.641
GREG: Okay. (LAUGHS NERVOUSLY)

01:00:45.174 --> 01:00:46.576
(ROMAN ROY CHUCKLES)

01:00:46.609 --> 01:00:47.810
LOGAN: Roman!

01:00:48.844 --> 01:00:50.380
I like it for real, Dad,

01:00:50.446 --> 01:00:52.048
-I wanna help--
-Stand the fuck up.

01:00:53.382 --> 01:00:54.784
Um, okay.

01:00:59.588 --> 01:01:01.758
Kendall took a call
from the biographer.

01:01:02.458 --> 01:01:03.726
We all got a call, Rome.

01:01:03.759 --> 01:01:05.628
Okay, yes, but you--
See, he seemed like

01:01:05.694 --> 01:01:07.330
he wanted to actually
talk to her.

01:01:07.730 --> 01:01:09.198
To smoke you out for Dad.

01:01:09.398 --> 01:01:11.600
What? Fuck you. Why'd you get
to smoke me out?

01:01:11.633 --> 01:01:12.868
I was smokin' you out.

01:01:12.901 --> 01:01:14.970
Why don't you tell us
about your mystery call?

01:01:15.337 --> 01:01:16.338
The phone call?

01:01:16.738 --> 01:01:18.040
Uh, yeah. It was Frank.

01:01:18.507 --> 01:01:19.541
He meant to call you.

01:01:20.109 --> 01:01:22.011
He wants to know if the plan to
overthrow Dad
is still happening.

01:01:23.379 --> 01:01:25.782
Someone spiked Pierce.

01:01:27.116 --> 01:01:29.284
Which one of you boars
did it?

01:01:29.451 --> 01:01:31.120
-Tom!
-Yes?

01:01:31.187 --> 01:01:32.488
Sit on the floor!

01:01:32.688 --> 01:01:33.889
It's fun.

01:01:34.490 --> 01:01:35.891
-Seriously?
-Yeah, it's a game!

01:01:35.925 --> 01:01:38.394
-Boar on the floor!
-TOM WAMBSGANS:
I really-- I feel--

01:01:38.461 --> 01:01:39.895
LOGAN: Get down!

01:01:40.196 --> 01:01:41.897
Boar on the floor.

01:01:42.164 --> 01:01:44.633
Boar on the floor.
Kendall, bring the troops.

01:01:44.800 --> 01:01:47.603
ALL: (CHANTING)
Boar on the floor.

01:01:47.636 --> 01:01:49.005
-Get down!
-ALL: Boar on the floor.

01:01:49.038 --> 01:01:51.240
-Greg! On the floor, boar.
-(CHANTING CONTINUES)

01:01:52.140 --> 01:01:54.844
-(CHANTING CONTINUES)
-Come on, Frank!

01:01:55.911 --> 01:01:56.812
Why am I in this?

01:01:56.879 --> 01:01:58.214
How the fuck would I know, Greg?

01:01:58.280 --> 01:02:00.015
You think I have a rational
explanation for this?

01:02:00.049 --> 01:02:03.085
Frank! Feed the piggies,
guests of honor!

01:02:03.552 --> 01:02:06.255
That's it. Boar on the floor!

01:02:06.288 --> 01:02:07.990
ALL: Boar on the floor!

01:02:08.057 --> 01:02:10.826
Oink for your sausages,
piggies. Shh. Shh. Shh.

01:02:11.127 --> 01:02:13.462
Oink for your sausages,
piggies. Oink.

01:02:13.528 --> 01:02:14.730
KARL: Oh, Jesus Christ.

01:02:14.930 --> 01:02:17.133
Oink for your sausage, Tom.
Oink.

01:02:17.199 --> 01:02:18.033
Oink.

01:02:18.067 --> 01:02:19.368
-LOGAN: No.
-(TOM SNORTING)

01:02:19.435 --> 01:02:20.936
No half-hearted oink.
I want full-bodied oinks.

01:02:20.969 --> 01:02:22.939
-I'm not doing it.
-KARL: Oink, oink, oink.

01:02:23.005 --> 01:02:24.473
On the count of three,

01:02:25.007 --> 01:02:28.944
the last piggy to eat
a sausage is the mole.

01:02:29.011 --> 01:02:30.980
That doesn't seem like
a very good system...

01:02:31.046 --> 01:02:33.248
Who spoke to Pantsil?

01:02:33.415 --> 01:02:34.884
(WHISPERING) Please.

01:02:36.686 --> 01:02:37.787
Hey!

01:02:37.820 --> 01:02:40.689
Crawl in a circle
and close your eyes.

01:02:40.756 --> 01:02:42.058
-(LAUGHTER)
-Three...

01:02:42.125 --> 01:02:43.225
Greg, oink.

01:02:43.292 --> 01:02:45.027
(GREG SNORTS)

01:02:45.361 --> 01:02:46.161
Two...

01:02:46.294 --> 01:02:48.030
(GREG, TOM AND KARL SNORTING
AND OINKING)

01:02:48.063 --> 01:02:49.065
One...

01:02:49.665 --> 01:02:51.667
(CHEERING AND LAUGHING)

01:02:52.000 --> 01:02:53.903
Eat the sausage, Tom!

01:02:54.503 --> 01:02:56.172
-TOM: I got it!
-(JEERING)

01:03:00.309 --> 01:03:02.211
(SHOUTING AND CLAMORING)

01:03:02.578 --> 01:03:04.247
GREG: It's my fucking sausage!

01:03:06.715 --> 01:03:08.217
MAN 1: Take it out of his hand!

01:03:08.284 --> 01:03:09.084
MAN 2: Come on!

01:03:09.284 --> 01:03:12.621
Karl stole my sausage!
Karl stole my sausage.

01:03:12.988 --> 01:03:16.793
Too effing slow.
I'll get you your booby prize.

01:03:17.727 --> 01:03:19.094
Eat up, piggies.

01:03:19.327 --> 01:03:21.396
ROMAN: I believe he said
"Eat up, piggies."

01:03:21.463 --> 01:03:24.266
I wanna see you little
piggy fucks eat. Eat it.

01:03:24.333 --> 01:03:25.968
Indemnification,
you fuckin' dummy.

01:03:26.001 --> 01:03:27.669
Wh-- You fucking serious?
How old are you?

01:03:27.736 --> 01:03:28.770
Give me back my fucking phone.

01:03:29.104 --> 01:03:30.640
-Huh? What are you hiding?
-What are you-- Wh-- Hiding?

01:03:30.706 --> 01:03:31.907
Nothing. Give me back
my fucking phone.

01:03:31.974 --> 01:03:33.342
-What's your code?
-Are you fucking serious?

01:03:33.409 --> 01:03:34.977
-Yeah. What's your--
-My code? Uh, my code is,

01:03:35.010 --> 01:03:37.379
um, fuck you-- What?

01:03:38.046 --> 01:03:40.416
(KENDALL AND ROMAN
ARGUING INDISTINCTLY)

01:03:42.551 --> 01:03:45.588
Okay, you got it. All right?
Happy? There's nothing in there.

